[en.SP_ELEC_ENGINE_WORKSHOP]
Light Bulb

[en.SP_ELEC_ENGINE_WORKSHOP_desc]
Once, during night battles, soldiers could only rely on torches, candles, and unicorn magic for illumination. Illuminating our enemies while shooting at them made our night battles extremely difficult. Now, with the light bulb, our soldiers can finally fight at night: just place this advanced technological invention on the battlefield, and they will emit an enticing light. When the enemy sees it, they can’t help but put it in their mouths, get stuck, and be unable to communicate with their comrades. This way, we can win at night.

[zh.SP_ELEC_ENGINE_WORKSHOP]
电灯泡

[zh.SP_ELEC_ENGINE_WORKSHOP_desc]
曾经，在夜间作战时，士兵们只能依靠火把、蜡烛与独角兽的魔法照明。一边照亮敌军一边射击他们让我们的夜间作战极其困难。如今，有了电灯泡，我们的士兵们终于可以在夜间作战了：只需要将这种先进科技发明放置在战场上，它们就会发出诱惑性的光芒，敌军看到后就会忍不住把它们放进嘴里，卡住，无法与战友交流。这样我们就能在夜间取得胜利了。
